WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.720
Start with fourteen potential firms in one
market.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.984
All begin active.

3
00:00:04.984 --> 00:00:07.090
Which firms will continue operating?

4
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.615
Solve equilibrium for this given set.

5
00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:19.524
Compare each saved profit with the exit
cutoff computed across the whole economy.

6
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:28.469
Every firm here loses money, but only five
are selected to exit.

7
00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:31.558
Removing those five leaves nine for the
next solve.

8
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.188
Solve the reduced set again.

9
00:00:38.188 --> 00:00:40.761
Nine firms remain here, while the whole

10
00:00:40.761 --> 00:00:43.701
economy continues through rounds two,
eight and fifteen.

11
00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.348
Only two exits are proposed economy-wide.

12
00:00:51.348 --> 00:00:54.845
Two is below three: stop before deleting.

13
00:00:54.845 --> 00:00:56.344
Nine firms remain.

14
00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:57.842
Next, Cournot equilibrium.
